LNG:blueprint_update_title_frontmatter_gap_0002{
{type:"handler_defect", cause:"In project Manhattan BLP-007 (2026-09-07), blueprint.update(section=TITLE, content=...) rewrote only the <!-- BLP:TITLE --> body block. The YAML frontmatter field title: kept the original value from blueprint.create. blueprint.list and blueprint.read then reported the stale title. Detected by Heimdall audit (OBS-10)", lesson:"blueprint.update does not propagate TITLE changes to frontmatter title:. The two sources of truth diverge silently. Workaround applied: manual edit of frontmatter line, explicitly authorized by the Architect and traced in a progress note", prevention:"Fix blueprint.update: when section == TITLE, also rewrite frontmatter title: (strip leading '# BLP-NNN: ' prefix). Add a validation in blueprint.read that warns when frontmatter title differs from TITLE body. Until fixed: agents must request Architect authorization for the manual frontmatter edit and record it as a progress note", status:"current"}
}

